sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant R as Receiver
  participant M as Manager
  participant DB as SSOT (schema ipm)
  participant P as Publisher
  participant REC as Reconciler
  participant OB as Observer
  participant EX as Executor
  participant Z as Zitadel
  U->>R: POST /v1/ipm/organizations {name}
  R->>R: valida o token, a role ipm.organization.create, o e-mail verificado e a cota
  R->>M: requested-create (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 resourceId e operationId
  M->>DB: Organization present (Pending), Operation accepted, outbox desired
  P->>DB: lê o outbox pendente, em ordem
  P->>REC: desired (DESIRED)
  P->>OB: desired (DESIRED)
  OB->>Z: ListOrganizations pelo resourceId
  OB->>REC: observed absent (OBSERVED)
  OB->>M: observed absent (fase Reconciling, Operation in_progress)
  REC->>EX: action create (ACTION)
  EX->>EX: revalida a ação contra o desired vigente
  EX->>Z: AddOrganization com o resourceId como ID
  EX->>REC: completed (RESULT)
  EX->>OB: completed (RESULT)
  OB->>Z: lê a organização de novo
  OB->>REC: observed present (name, granted, active)
  OB->>M: observed present (fase Ready, Operation completed)
  U->>R: GET /v1/ipm/organizations/{resourceId}
  R-->>U: 200 phase Ready
